<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Agreement Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .header-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .header-table td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .label {
    font-weight: bold;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .input-area {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    min-height: 20px;
  }
  .checkbox-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    font-weight: normal;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
  .table-container {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  .table-container th, .table-container td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .table-container th {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <table class="header-table">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">
        <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="max-width: 150px;">
      </td>
      <td style="width: 70%; text-align: left;">
        <h1 style="margin: 0;">UNIVERSITY OF WISCONSIN SYSTEM</h1>
        <h2 style="margin: 0;">EARLY COLLEGE CREDIT PROGRAM AND HIGH SCHOOL SPECIAL AGREEMENT FORM</h2>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>Complete this form if you are currently enrolled in high school and wish to enroll for undergraduate courses at a University of Wisconsin (UW) System institution before high school graduation. Please carefully read the instructions on page two before completing any part of this form. A separate form must be completed for each term with you to enroll at a UW System institution.</p>

  <div class="section-title">SECTION I – STUDENT INFORMATION (TO BE COMPLETED BY STUDENT) (PLEASE TYPE OR PRINT IN INK)</div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex-basis: 30%;">
      <span class="label">Applying to:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="applying_to">{{ applying_to }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 30%;">
      <span class="label">Applying for:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="applying_for">{{ applying_for }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 40%;">
      <span class="label">Applying as (check all that apply):</span>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> Early College Credit (school determines tuition payment)</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> High School Special (student pays tuition)</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex-basis: 25%;">
      <span class="label">First Name:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="full_name_first">{{ full_name_first }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 25%;">
      <span class="label">Middle Initial:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="full_name_middle">{{ full_name_middle }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 25%;">
      <span class="label">Last Name:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="full_name_last">{{ full_name_last }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 25%;">
      <span class="label">Date of Birth (mm/dd/yyyy):</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="date_of_birth">{{ date_of_birth }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex-basis: 25%;">
      <span class="label">Email:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 25%;">
      <span class="label">Phone:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 50%;">
      <span class="label">High School:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="high_school">{{ high_school }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex-basis: 50%;">
      <span class="label">Anticipated Year of Graduation:</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="graduation_year">{{ graduation_year }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>I certify that the information in this application is true and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that inaccurate information may affect my eligibility to enroll. If I enroll in the UW System, I will abide by all regulations, policies and procedures. I also understand that courses taken at any UW System institution will become part of my permanent university record and may affect my subsequent eligibility for admission to post-secondary institutions. I authorize the UW System to provide information about my course registration, grades and attendance to my high school, school district administrator and school board.</p>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      <span class="label">Student Applicant Signature & Date</span>
      <div class="input-area" style="width: 40%;"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="label">Parent/Guardian/Foster Parent Signature & Date</span>
      <div class="input-area" style="width: 40%;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="section-title">SECTION II – COURSE INFORMATION TO BE COMPLETED BY STUDENT (WITH HELP FROM COUNSELOR)</div>

  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Course(s) Intending to Take</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Department and Course #</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"># of Credits</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Early College Credit Program</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">District Approval (Completed by School District)</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">High School Special</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>EXAMPLE: College Writing I</td>
        <td>ENG-110</td>
        <td>3</td>
        <td><span data-field="course_credit_program_check">{{ course_credit_program_check }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="district_approval_yes">{{ district_approval_yes }}</span> / <span data-field="district_approval_no">{{ district_approval_no }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="high_school_special_yes">{{ high_school_special_yes }}</span> / <span data-field="high_school_special_no">{{ high_school_special_no }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% for item in course_details %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_name">{{ item.course_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].department_course_number">{{ item.department_course_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].credit_program_check">{{ item.credit_program_check }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].district_approval_yes">{{ item.district_approval_yes }}</span> / <span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].district_approval_no">{{ item.district_approval_no }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].high_school_special_yes">{{ item.high_school_special_yes }}</span> / <span data-field="course_details[{{ loop.index0 }}].high_school_special_no">{{ item.high_school_special_no }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>Indicate how you meet the prerequisites and your academic need for this course:</p>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 100%;">Prerequisite/Need Statement</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in prerequisite_statements %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="prerequisite_statements[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ item.statement }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>Indicate how you meet the prerequisites and your academic need for this course:</p>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 100%;">Prerequisite/Need Statement</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in prerequisite_statements_2 %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="prerequisite_statements_2[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ item.statement }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>Indicate how you meet the prerequisites and your academic need for this course:</p>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 100%;">Prerequisite/Need Statement</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in prerequisite_statements_3 %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="prerequisite_statements_3[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ item.statement }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>Indicate how you meet the prerequisites and your academic need for this course:</p>
  <table class="table-container">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 100%;">Prerequisite/Need Statement</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in prerequisite_statements_4 %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="prerequisite_statements_4[{{ loop.index0 }}]">{{ item.statement }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="section-title">SECTION III – TO BE COMPLETED BY THE SCHOOL DISTRICT APPROVAL AUTHORITY/HIGH SCHOOL COUNSELOR/PRINCIPAL</div>

  <p>This student has the permission of the high school administration to enroll in the above listed courses at the indicated UW System institution.</p>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      <span class="label">School District Approval Authority & Date</span>
      <div class="input-area" style="width: 40%;"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="label">High School Counselor/Staff Advisor Signature & Date</span>
      <div class="input-area" style="width: 40%;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div style="flex-basis: 33%;">
      <span class="label">Printed Name (Counselor/Advisor)</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="counselor_printed_name">{{ counselor_printed_name }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 33%;">
      <span class="label">School Email Address (Counselor/Advisor)</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="counselor_email">{{ counselor_email }}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex-basis: 33%;">
      <span class="label">Phone Number (Counselor/Advisor)</span>
      <div class="input-area"><span data-field="counselor_phone">{{ counselor_phone }}</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 40px;">NOTE: School District approval does not guarantee admission to the university. Course enrollment is not guaranteed and subject to availability. If not participating in the Early College Credit Program, School District approval is not required.</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>